      equipment: 'Standard pack, score sheet.',
      dealing: "Dealer deals 4 cards to each player and 4 cards face-up to the 'Floor' (middle). If a Jack or 7 of Diamonds appears on the floor during the initial deal, it is buried in the deck and replaced.",
